      "body": "Code review ACK 02380237ddd2ed6878d7a3b0ae2807cfcf2cd9ff. Thanks for finding and fixing this!\r\n\r\nIt makes sense to merge this before #36753, which moves the `-rpcwhitelistdefault` check after parsing, so more users can reach this code. I'll rebase that PR on this one.\r\n\r\nThe suggestions below are all optional. The [main one](https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36758#discussion_r4472663469) is to fix this in `JSONErrorReply()` instead of adding another try/catch, so it covers every error thrown after the version is known, and #36753 could use it as well.",
